#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3761
msgid "The diagnosis is run by the Nurevo service at nurevo.jp. Nothing has been sent yet: the plugin contacts the service only after you agree here."
msgstr "ການວິນິດໄສດຳເນີນໂດຍບໍລິການ Nurevo ທີ່ nurevo.jp. ຍັງບໍ່ມີຫຍັງຖືກສົ່ງ: ປລັກອິນຈະຕິດຕໍ່ບໍລິການພຽງແຕ່ຫຼັງຈາກທ່ານຍອມຮັບຢູ່ບ່ອນນີ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/includes/cli.php:78
msgid "The diagnosis sends this site’s URL to the Nurevo service. Run again with --consent to agree."
msgstr "ການວິນິດໄສຈະສົ່ງ URL ຂອງເວັບໄຊນີ້ໄປຫາບໍລິການ Nurevo. ດຳເນີນການອີກຄັ້ງດ້ວຍ --consent ເພື່ອຍອມຮັບ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5510
msgid "The file contains keys or connection settings, which are never imported: %s"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ມີກະແຈ ຫຼື ການຕັ້ງຄ່າການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ ເຊິ່ງຈະບໍ່ຖືກນຳເຂົ້າ: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5518
msgid "The file contains settings this version does not know: %s"
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ມີການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ເວີຊັນນີ້ບໍ່ຮູ້ຈັກ: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5504
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5524
msgid "The file is not a valid Nurevo AEO settings file."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Nurevo AEO ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5496
msgid "The file is not valid JSON."
msgstr "ໄຟລ໌ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນ JSON ທີ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4786
msgid "The free plan runs on the criteria bundled with the plugin. Your diagnosis, basic schema, llms.txt and AI crawler access all keep working."
msgstr "ແພັກເກດຟຣີເຮັດວຽກຕາມເກນທີ່ມາພ້ອມປລັກອິນ. ການວິນິດໄສ, schema ພື້ນຖານ, llms.txt ແລະ ການເຂົ້າເຖິງຂອງ AI crawler ຍັງເຮັດວຽກຕໍ່ໄປ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4735
msgid "The last %d measurements, oldest on the left"
msgstr "%d ການວັດແທກຫຼ້າສຸດ, ເກົ່າສຸດຢູ່ເບື້ອງຊ້າຍ"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2886
msgid "The license could not be verified. The previously verified plan remains active."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດກວດສອບລິຂະສິດໄດ້. ແພັກເກດທີ່ກວດສອບກ່ອນໜ້ານີ້ຍັງໃຊ້ງານຢູ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2822
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2882
msgid "The license key is invalid or inactive."
msgstr "ກະແຈລິຂະສິດບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ບໍ່ໄດ້ໃຊ້ງານ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2835
msgid "The license server is not configured."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າເຊີບເວີລິຂະສິດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1931
msgid "The major AI crawlers are allowed in robots.txt."
msgstr "AI crawler ຫຼັກໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃນ robots.txt."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2808
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2816
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4337
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4476
msgid "The Nurevo service could not be reached."
msgstr "ບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງບໍລິການ Nurevo ໄດ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3627
msgid "The Nurevo service did not accept this site’s connection: %s"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ Nurevo ບໍ່ຍອມຮັບການເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂອງເວັບໄຊນີ້: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3609
msgid "The Nurevo service did not answer within %d seconds. Your server may not be allowed to make outgoing connections, or the service may be busy. Please try again later."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ Nurevo ບໍ່ໄດ້ຕອບກັບພາຍໃນ %d ວິນາທີ. ເຊີບເວີຂອງທ່ານອາດບໍ່ໄດ້ຮັບອະນຸຍາດໃຫ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ຂາອອກ ຫຼື ບໍລິການອາດຫຍຸ້ງຢູ່. ກະລຸນາລອງໃໝ່ພາຍຫຼັງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2750
msgid "The Nurevo service is not configured."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍລິການ Nurevo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3372
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3640
msgid "The Nurevo service returned an error: %s"
msgstr "ບໍລິການ Nurevo ສົ່ງຄືນຂໍ້ຜິດພາດ: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3365
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3552
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3556
msgid "The Nurevo service sent a response this plugin could not read."
msgstr "ບໍລິການ Nurevo ສົ່ງການຕອບກັບທີ່ປລັກອິນນີ້ອ່ານບໍ່ໄດ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3634
msgid "The Nurevo service URL in Settings did not lead to the Nurevo service: %s"
msgstr "URL ບໍລິການ Nurevo ໃນການຕັ້ງຄ່າບໍ່ໄດ້ນຳໄປຫາບໍລິການ Nurevo: %s"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3339
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3506
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3599
msgid "The Nurevo service URL is not set. Open Nurevo AEO > Settings and check it under Advanced."
msgstr "ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ຕັ້ງ URL ບໍລິການ Nurevo. ເປີດ Nurevo AEO > ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ກວດສອບໃນສ່ວນຂັ້ນສູງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1963
msgid "The page text does not state your key facts, so AI has only your markup to go on."
msgstr "ຂໍ້ຄວາມໃນໜ້າບໍ່ໄດ້ລະບຸຂໍ້ມູນສຳຄັນຂອງທ່ານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ AI ຈຶ່ງມີແຕ່ markup ໃຫ້ອີງໃສ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2737
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2806
msgid "The pairing code is invalid or has expired."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຈັບຄູ່ບໍ່ຖືກຕ້ອງ ຫຼື ໝົດອາຍຸແລ້ວ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4335
msgid "The profile sync was rejected by the service."
msgstr "ບໍລິການປະຕິເສດການຊິງຄ໌ໂປຣໄຟລ໌."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1945
msgid "The raw HTML carries neither your content nor your schema, so crawlers that skip JavaScript see an empty page."
msgstr "HTML ດິບບໍ່ມີທັງເນື້ອຫາ ແລະ schema ຂອງທ່ານ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນ crawler ທີ່ຂ້າມ JavaScript ຈະເຫັນໜ້າຫວ່າງເປົ່າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5025
msgid "The service could not diagnose this site. This usually means it is not reachable from the internet yet - a local or password-protected site cannot be read."
msgstr "ບໍລິການບໍ່ສາມາດວິນິດໄສເວັບໄຊນີ້ໄດ້. ໂດຍທົ່ວໄປໝາຍຄວາມວ່າເວັບໄຊຍັງບໍ່ສາມາດເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ຈາກອິນເຕີເນັດ - ເວັບໄຊພາຍໃນເຄື່ອງ ຫຼື ທີ່ປ້ອງກັນດ້ວຍລະຫັດຜ່ານບໍ່ສາມາດອ່ານໄດ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4730
msgid "The trend appears once a second measurement has run."
msgstr "ແນວໂນ້ມຈະສະແດງຫຼັງຈາກການວັດແທກຄັ້ງທີສອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3478
msgid "There is no site key to disable."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີກະແຈເວັບໄຊໃຫ້ປິດໃຊ້ງານ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3456
msgid "There is no site key to regenerate."
msgstr "ບໍ່ມີກະແຈເວັບໄຊໃຫ້ສ້າງໃໝ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1225
msgid "These collect content to train AI models. They are not needed to appear in AI answers, so this is your choice."
msgstr "ພວກມັນເກັບເນື້ອຫາເພື່ອຝຶກໂມເດວ AI. ບໍ່ຈຳເປັນເພື່ອປາກົດໃນຄຳຕອບຂອງ AI, ສະນັ້ນທ່ານເລືອກໄດ້ເອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:1207
msgid "These fetch your pages to answer and cite them. Your existing robots.txt rules, such as /wp-admin/, keep applying to them."
msgstr "ພວກມັນດຶງໜ້າເວັບຂອງທ່ານເພື່ອຕອບຄຳຖາມ ແລະ ອ້າງອີງ. ກົດ robots.txt ທີ່ມີຢູ່ຂອງທ່ານ ເຊັ່ນ /wp-admin/ ຍັງຄົງນຳໃຊ້ກັບພວກມັນ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5010
msgid "These were inferred from your existing settings and published content. Only blank fields were filled, so please check that the values are right."
msgstr "ຄ່າເຫຼົ່ານີ້ອະນຸມານຈາກການຕັ້ງຄ່າທີ່ມີຢູ່ ແລະ ເນື້ອຫາທີ່ເຜີຍແຜ່ແລ້ວ. ຕື່ມສະເພາະຊ່ອງທີ່ວ່າງເທົ່ານັ້ນ, ກະລຸນາກວດສອບວ່າຄ່າຖືກຕ້ອງ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2792
msgid "This code belongs to a site registered as %s. Pair it from that site, or correct the site address on the dashboard."
msgstr "ລະຫັດນີ້ເປັນຂອງເວັບໄຊທີ່ລົງທະບຽນເປັນ %s. ຈັບຄູ່ຈາກເວັບໄຊນັ້ນ ຫຼື ແກ້ໄຂທີ່ຢູ່ເວັບໄຊໃນແດຊບອດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:4762
msgid "This is a beta feature. AI answers vary from run to run, so judge by the trend rather than any single result."
msgstr "ນີ້ແມ່ນຄຸນສົມບັດ beta. ຄຳຕອບຂອງ AI ແຕກຕ່າງກັນໃນແຕ່ລະຄັ້ງ, ດັ່ງນັ້ນໃຫ້ຕັດສິນຈາກແນວໂນ້ມແທນຜົນຄັ້ງດຽວ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:5499
msgid "This is not a Nurevo AEO settings file."
msgstr "ນີ້ບໍ່ແມ່ນໄຟລ໌ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ Nurevo AEO."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2871
msgid "This license has no seats left. Release another site from the Nurevo dashboard, or use a license with more seats."
msgstr "ລິຂະສິດນີ້ບໍ່ມີສິດໃຊ້ງານເຫຼືອແລ້ວ. ປົດເວັບໄຊອື່ນອອກຈາກແດຊບອດ Nurevo ຫຼື ໃຊ້ລິຂະສິດທີ່ມີສິດໃຊ້ງານຫຼາຍກວ່າ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2874
msgid "This license is not attached to an account yet. Please contact Nurevo support."
msgstr "ລິຂະສິດນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມກັບບັນຊີ. ກະລຸນາຕິດຕໍ່ທີມຊ່ວຍເຫຼືອ Nurevo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:449
msgid "This page’s own questions"
msgstr "ຄຳຖາມສະເພາະຂອງໜ້ານີ້"

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2797
msgid "This pairing code has already been used by another site. Issue a new one from the dashboard."
msgstr "ລະຫັດຈັບຄູ່ນີ້ຖືກໃຊ້ໂດຍເວັບໄຊອື່ນແລ້ວ. ອອກລະຫັດໃໝ່ຈາກແດຊບອດ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2877
msgid "This site has no public domain to register. A license can only be activated on a publicly reachable site."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ບໍ່ມີໂດເມນສາທາລະນະໃຫ້ລົງທະບຽນ. ລິຂະສິດສາມາດເປີດໃຊ້ໄດ້ສະເພາະເວັບໄຊທີ່ເຂົ້າເຖິງໄດ້ສາທາລະນະ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3412
msgid "This site is already registered. Regenerate the key with an administrator token if the existing key is unavailable."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ລົງທະບຽນແລ້ວ. ສ້າງກະແຈໃໝ່ດ້ວຍໂທເຄັນຜູ້ດູແລລະບົບ ຖ້າກະແຈທີ່ມີຢູ່ໃຊ້ບໍ່ໄດ້."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3502
#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3602
msgid "This site is not connected to Nurevo yet. Open Nurevo AEO > Settings and pair it with a pairing code."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ຍັງບໍ່ໄດ້ເຊື່ອມຕໍ່ກັບ Nurevo. ເປີດ Nurevo AEO > ການຕັ້ງຄ່າ ແລະ ຈັບຄູ່ດ້ວຍລະຫັດຈັບຄູ່."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3796
msgid "This site uses the Nurevo AEO plugin to publish structured data, llms.txt and AI crawler rules. These are produced on this site’s own server. By default the plugin adds no tracking script to public pages and sends no visitor data to the Nurevo service."
msgstr "ເວັບໄຊນີ້ໃຊ້ປລັກອິນ Nurevo AEO ເພື່ອເຜີຍແຜ່ຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງ, llms.txt ແລະ ກົດຂອງ AI crawler. ສິ່ງເຫຼົ່ານີ້ຖືກສ້າງຂຶ້ນເທິງເຊີບເວີຂອງເວັບໄຊນີ້ເອງ. ໂດຍຄ່າເລີ່ມຕົ້ນ, ປລັກອິນບໍ່ເພີ່ມສະຄຣິບຕິດຕາມໃດໆໃນໜ້າສາທາລະນະ ແລະ ບໍ່ສົ່ງຂໍ້ມູນຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມໄປຫາບໍລິການ Nurevo."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:3765
msgid "Tick the box to agree before running the diagnosis."
msgstr "ໝາຍຕິກໃນກ່ອງເພື່ອຍອມຮັບກ່ອນດຳເນີນການວິນິດໄສ."

#: wordpress-plugin/webmcp-canary/nurevo-webmcp.php:2489
msgid "To publish the FAQ, place the %1$s block or the %2$s shortcode on the page where it should appear. The questions are shown there and published as FAQPage structured data on that page only; search engines accept FAQ markup only for questions visitors can read."
msgstr "ເພື່ອເຜີຍແຜ່ FAQ, ໃຫ້ວາງບລັອກ %1$s ຫຼື shortcode %2$s ໃນໜ້າທີ່ຕ້ອງການໃຫ້ສະແດງ. ຄຳຖາມຈະສະແດງຢູ່ບ່ອນນັ້ນ ແລະ ເຜີຍແຜ່ເປັນຂໍ້ມູນທີ່ມີໂຄງສ້າງ FAQPage ສະເພາະໃນໜ້ານັ້ນເທົ່ານັ້ນ; ເຄື່ອງມືຄົ້ນຫາຍອມຮັບ markup FAQ ສະເພາະຄຳຖາມທີ່ຜູ້ເຂົ້າຊົມອ່ານໄດ້ເທົ່ານັ້ນ."

